# Binding documents (read before working)

Gurukul has three binding documents. Where code and spec disagree, **the spec
wins and the code is the bug**.

1. `docs/locked-decisions.md` — the product spec. Where code and spec disagree,
   the spec wins and the code is the bug.
2. `docs/gurukul-spec-rules.md` — **rules 1–31, binding.** Read in full before
   working. (Was omitted from an earlier version of this rule only because it
   appeared absent on a stale checkout at tip `7c8b435`; it is present from
   `4ee4dae` onward.)
3. `KNOWN_ISSUES.md` (repo root) — deferred work / known findings.
   Note: it contains **two sections numbered 8**; both are real, not a typo.

